  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Company: DOGSHT&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">As a sister-owned dog company, our passion for dogs, dedication to supporting local, and love for spreading smiles drive our mission. From locally sourced dog treats to our playful DOGSHT collection, featuring human hats and dog robes, our aim is to not only bring joy but also practicality and convenience to both furry friends and their humans</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product: DOGSHT WraPUP</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span>Experience the&nbsp;ultimate solution for drying off your fur babe after baths or water adventures with the DOGSHT WraPUP dog robes. Proudly made in Texas, these robes keep your furry companion comfortable and mess-free.</span></p>\r\n<p>After a refreshing bath, dogs can't help but indulge in their favorite post-bath activity: the infamous zoomies! But we all know what happens next&mdash;muddy paws on the floor, wet fur on the couch, and a distinct wet dog odor lingering around. It's time to bid farewell to that wet dog chaos!</p>\r\n<p>Designed with both practicality and cuteness in mind, the DOGSHT WraPUPs are a must-have for every dog owner.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Practical &amp; Adorable</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Made in Texas</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Superior quality &amp; effectiveness</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weig